  "chapterContent": {
    "c1": [
      { "type": "h1", "text": "1. The Professional Opportunity" },
      { "type": "h2", "text": "1.1 A Changing Healthcare Landscape" },
      { "type": "p", "text": "The demand for high-quality, accessible professional services has never been greater. As healthcare systems evolve and communities seek more personalized care, independent practitioners are uniquely positioned to fill critical gaps in service delivery." },
      { "type": "p", "text": "Establishing a successful professional practice requires a clear understanding of the opportunities, challenges, and responsibilities involved. This chapter explores the current landscape, key trends, and the factors that make this an ideal time to consider independent practice." },
      { "type": "callout", "variant": "keyTakeaway", "title": "Key Takeaway", "text": "Independent practice offers greater autonomy, the opportunity to align your values with your work, and the potential for long-term financial sustainability when approached with a clear strategy." },
      { "type": "h2", "text": "1.2 Market Demand and Opportunities" },
      { "type": "p", "text": "Several factors are driving increased demand for independent practitioners, including demographic changes, increased awareness of specialized services, and growing interest in personalized care." }
    ]
  },
